5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to look at the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to check where the last awkward conversation happened and the unplanned talk since the refit.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m picking the invoices for outside hire and the round trip for a hot lunch. I need to see where our hours and money are actually leaking before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m taking the quotes for the two fit-outs and the partition wall. I need the hard numbers and the acoustic reality before we sign anything.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I will look into the crumbs and bins at the desks, and the facilities callouts on this floor.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I’m curious why Jonathan is focusing on the awkward conversation. Is that relevant to the room’s function, or just personal history?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It’s relevant. If we can’t speak freely here, the room fails its purpose. I’m checking if the layout prevents that.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, that’s a lovely sentiment, but I’m watching the clock. If we can’t eat here, we’re walking twenty-five minutes for lunch. That’s a leak I can’t ignore.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, twenty-five minutes is a leak, yes. But if the wall is thin, we’re just moving the noise problem. I need to know if the partition holds before we waste money on fit-outs.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the wall is a single sheet of plasterboard. Sound passes through easily. We must consider privacy, not just cost.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, that confirms my suspicion. If sound travels freely, a quiet room is impossible. I need to know who actually uses the space to justify any fit-out.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, usage data is vital, but so is the human element. If we only optimize for efficiency, we ignore why people avoid this space.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, efficiency is exactly why I’m here. If the room is just a noise box, we’re wasting money on furniture. I need to know if the hours saved are real.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, usage data is fine, but it doesn’t pay the electrician. I’m waiting on those quotes. If the partition fails, the quiet room is a fantasy, and I won’t sign for it.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, you are right to be cautious. But remember, a room is not just a box; it is a space for connection. Let us see what the data reveals.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I’ll wait for the tally. If the two nearest the door dominate usage, the current setup is broken. I need proof before we spend.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I’m hoping the data shows we’ve lost our chance to talk. If we can’t connect, the room is just a box.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I’m done.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
