24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’m done.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,1,4,talk,Servas,,I am content to wait. The truth will emerge from the details.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
