36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The tally shows two people used it eleven times; the rest, four. The fridge clearing was done twice by one person. The burden is uneven.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The awkward talk happened across open desks, and unplanned chats now only occur by the printer. We are becoming strangers.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"68,000 yen for nine tiny bookings, and twenty-five minutes to lunch. We are bleeding money and time.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"141,000 for a screen, 96,000 for a hob. And the wall is plasterboard. You can hear everything. I’m not signing for a leaky box.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Three keyboards hold crumbs, and bins go out daily. Eleven callouts for equipment, none for the empty store. The mess is real, but the silence is deeper.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the plasterboard confirms the noise issue. But the tally proves the current system is broken. We need a rule, not just a wall.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, the rule is missing, but the silence is the real wound. We need a place where difficult words can be said without an audience.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, 68,000 yen for nine tiny bookings is a waste. If we fit a kitchen, we stop paying that. The lunch walk is a daily tax.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the kitchen quote is cheaper, but the wall is still plasterboard. You’ll hear every sizzle. I need to know if that noise is acceptable before I sign.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the callouts show equipment causes the trouble, not the people. If we remove the clutter, the room breathes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Jonathan, the tally proves the current system is broken. We need a rule, not just a wall.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, rules are necessary, but they cannot fix the silence. We need a space where the awkwardness can finally be resolved, not just managed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, rules don’t pay the 68,000 yen. If we don’t eat here, we keep paying that hourly tax. I need the kitchen to stop the bleeding.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the kitchen is cheaper, but the plasterboard means you hear every sizzle. I won’t sign for a noisy mess. I need the figures to justify the cost.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@May, the crumbs prove the mess is already here. A kitchen would only deepen it. We must address the source, not the symptom.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, the fridge data shows one person always cleans up. A shared kitchen just repeats that failure. I need a system that distributes the burden, not just a new mess.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, a system is good, but it cannot force connection. We need a place where the silence breaks, not just a place where the mess is managed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, the burden is real, but the 68,000 yen is bleeding out right now. I need to stop the financial leak before we fix the social one.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the burden is real, but the plasterboard is the killer. I won’t sign for a room where everyone hears everyone else. I need the figures to justify the cost.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, the burden is real, but the eleven callouts show equipment causes the trouble. A quiet room removes the noise, not the responsibility.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
